     "loi_giai": "$A=\\left( {{20}^{20}}+{{20}^{21}} \\right)+\\left( {{20}^{22}}+{{20}^{23}} \\right)+.....+\\left( {{20}^{70}}+{{20}^{71}} \\right)$\n$={{20}^{20}}\\left( 1+20 \\right)+{{20}^{22}}\\left( 1+20 \\right)+.....+{{20}^{70}}\\left( 1+20 \\right)$\n$=21\\left( {{20}^{20}}+{{20}^{22}}+...+{{20}^{70}} \\right)$\nVậy $A$ chia hết cho 21",
     "cum": [
      "Nhóm các số hạng thành từng cặp: $A=\\left( {{20}^{20}}+{{20}^{21}} \\right)+\\left( {{20}^{22}}+{{20}^{23}} \\right)+.....+\\left( {{20}^{70}}+{{20}^{71}} \\right)$",
      "Đặt nhân tử chung ${{20}^{20}}$ trong cặp đầu: $={{20}^{20}}\\left( 1+20 \\right)+{{20}^{22}}\\left( 1+20 \\right)+.....+{{20}^{70}}\\left( 1+20 \\right)$",
      "Vì $1+20=21$ nên $=21\\left( {{20}^{20}}+{{20}^{22}}+...+{{20}^{70}} \\right)$",
      "Do đó $A$ chia hết cho 21"
     ],
     "nhieu": [
